{"scene_id": "pt_enemy_13", "source": "/home/user/screenwrite-analyzers/data/analyzers/pdtrain/scenes/pt_enemy_13.fountain", "heading": "INT. ENEMY - CONTINUOUS", "cast": [{"id": 0, "name": "MS", "names": ["MS"], "gender": "?", "first": 124, "spoke": 0}], "units": [{"u": 0, "kind": "heading", "text": "INT. ENEMY - CONTINUOUS", "present": []}, {"u": 1, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 0, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 2, "kind": "action", "text": "The source is poisoned, man!", "para": 0, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 3, "kind": "action", "text": "Are you mad?", "para": 0, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 4, "kind": "action", "text": "We are making our living by retailing filth and corruption!", "para": 0, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 5, "kind": "action", "text": "The whole of our flourishing municipal life derives its sustenance from a lie!", "para": 0, "sent": 4, "present": []}, {"u": 6, "kind": "action", "text": "Peter Stockmann.", "para": 1, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 7, "kind": "action", "text": "All imagination\u2014or something even worse.", "para": 1, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 8, "kind": "action", "text": "The man who can throw out such offensive insinuations about his native town must be an enemy to our community.", "para": 1, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 9, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann (going up to him).", "para": 2, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 10, "kind": "action", "text": "Do you dare to\u2014!", "para": 2, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 11, "kind": "action", "text": "Mrs. Stockmann (throwing herself between them).", "para": 3, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 12, "kind": "action", "text": "Thomas!", "para": 3, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 13, "kind": "action", "text": "Petra (catching her father by the arm).", "para": 4, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 14, "kind": "action", "text": "Don't lose your temper, father!", "para": 4, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 15, "kind": "action", "text": "Peter Stockmann.", "para": 5, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 16, "kind": "action", "text": "I will not expose myself to violence.", "para": 5, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 17, "kind": "action", "text": "Now you have had a warning; so reflect on what you owe to yourself and your family.", "para": 5, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 18, "kind": "action", "text": "Goodbye.", "para": 5, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 19, "kind": "action", "text": "(Goes out.)", "para": 5, "sent": 4, "present": []}, {"u": 20, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann (walking up and down).", "para": 6, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 21, "kind": "action", "text": "Am I to put up with such treatment as this?", "para": 6, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 22, "kind": "action", "text": "In my own house, Katherine!", "para": 6, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 23, "kind": "action", "text": "What do you think of that!", "para": 6, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 24, "kind": "action", "text": "Mrs. Stockmann.", "para": 7, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 25, "kind": "action", "text": "Indeed it is both shameful and absurd, Thomas\u2014", "para": 7, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 26, "kind": "action", "text": "Petra.", "para": 8, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 27, "kind": "action", "text": "If only I could give uncle a piece of my mind\u2014", "para": 8, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 28, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 9, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 29, "kind": "action", "text": "It is my own fault.", "para": 9, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 30, "kind": "action", "text": "I ought to have flown out at him long ago!\u2014shown my teeth!\u2014bitten!", "para": 9, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 31, "kind": "action", "text": "To hear him call me an enemy to our community!", "para": 9, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 32, "kind": "action", "text": "Me!", "para": 9, "sent": 4, "present": []}, {"u": 33, "kind": "action", "text": "I shall not take that lying down, upon my soul!", "para": 9, "sent": 5, "present": []}, {"u": 34, "kind": "action", "text": "Mrs. Stockmann.", "para": 10, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 35, "kind": "action", "text": "But, dear Thomas, your brother has power on his side.", "para": 10, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 36, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 11, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 37, "kind": "action", "text": "Yes, but I have right on mine, I tell you.", "para": 11, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 38, "kind": "action", "text": "Mrs. Stockmann.", "para": 12, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 39, "kind": "action", "text": "Oh yes, right\u2014right.", "para": 12, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 40, "kind": "action", "text": "What is the use of having right on your side if you have not got might?", "para": 12, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 41, "kind": "action", "text": "Petra.", "para": 13, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 42, "kind": "action", "text": "Oh, mother!\u2014how can you say such a thing!", "para": 13, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 43, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 14, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 44, "kind": "action", "text": "Do you imagine that in a free country it is no use having right on your side?", "para": 14, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 45, "kind": "action", "text": "You are absurd, Katherine.", "para": 14, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 46, "kind": "action", "text": "Besides, haven't I got the liberal-minded, independent press to lead the way, and the compact majority behind me?", "para": 14, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 47, "kind": "action", "text": "That is might enough, I should think!", "para": 14, "sent": 4, "present": []}, {"u": 48, "kind": "action", "text": "Mrs. Stockmann.", "para": 15, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 49, "kind": "action", "text": "But, good heavens, Thomas, you don't mean to?", "para": 15, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 50, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 16, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 51, "kind": "action", "text": "Don't mean to what?", "para": 16, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 52, "kind": "action", "text": "Mrs. Stockmann.", "para": 17, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 53, "kind": "action", "text": "To set yourself up in opposition to your brother.", "para": 17, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 54, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 18, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 55, "kind": "action", "text": "In God's name, what else do you suppose I should do but take my stand on right and truth?", "para": 18, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 56, "kind": "action", "text": "Petra.", "para": 19, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 57, "kind": "action", "text": "Yes, I was just going to say that.", "para": 19, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 58, "kind": "action", "text": "Mrs. Stockmann.", "para": 20, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 59, "kind": "action", "text": "But it won't do you any earthly good.", "para": 20, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 60, "kind": "action", "text": "If they won't do it, they won't.", "para": 20, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 61, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 21, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 62, "kind": "action", "text": "Oho, Katherine!", "para": 21, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 63, "kind": "action", "text": "Just give me time, and you will see how I will carry the war into their camp.", "para": 21, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 64, "kind": "action", "text": "Mrs. Stockmann.", "para": 22, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 65, "kind": "action", "text": "Yes, you carry the war into their camp, and you get your dismissal\u2014that is what you will do.", "para": 22, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 66, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 23, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 67, "kind": "action", "text": "In any case I shall have done my duty towards the public\u2014towards the community, I, who am called its enemy!", "para": 23, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 68, "kind": "action", "text": "Mrs. Stockmann.", "para": 24, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 69, "kind": "action", "text": "But towards your family, Thomas?", "para": 24, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 70, "kind": "action", "text": "Towards your own home!", "para": 24, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 71, "kind": "action", "text": "Do you think that is doing your duty towards those you have to provide for?", "para": 24, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 72, "kind": "action", "text": "Petra.", "para": 25, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 73, "kind": "action", "text": "Ah, don't think always first of us, mother.", "para": 25, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 74, "kind": "action", "text": "Mrs. Stockmann.", "para": 26, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 75, "kind": "action", "text": "Oh, it is easy for you to talk; you are able to shift for yourself, if need be.", "para": 26, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 76, "kind": "action", "text": "But remember the boys, Thomas; and think a little of yourself too, and of me\u2014", "para": 26, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 77, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 27, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 78, "kind": "action", "text": "I think you are out of your senses, Katherine!", "para": 27, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 79, "kind": "action", "text": "If I were to be such a miserable coward as to go on my knees to Peter and his damned crew, do you suppose I should ever know an hour's peace of mind all my life afterwards?", "para": 27, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 80, "kind": "action", "text": "Mrs. Stockmann.", "para": 28, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 81, "kind": "action", "text": "I don't know anything about that; but God preserve us from the peace of mind we shall have, all the same, if you go on defying him!", "para": 28, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 82, "kind": "action", "text": "You will find yourself again without the means of subsistence, with no income to count upon.", "para": 28, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 83, "kind": "action", "text": "I should think we had had enough of that in the old days.", "para": 28, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 84, "kind": "action", "text": "Remember that, Thomas; think what that means.", "para": 28, "sent": 4, "present": []}, {"u": 85, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann (collecting himself with a struggle and clenching his fists).", "para": 29, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 86, "kind": "action", "text": "And this is what this slavery can bring upon a free, honourable man!", "para": 29, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 87, "kind": "action", "text": "Isn't it horrible, Katherine?", "para": 29, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 88, "kind": "action", "text": "Mrs. Stockmann.", "para": 30, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 89, "kind": "action", "text": "Yes, it is sinful to treat you so, it is perfectly true.", "para": 30, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 90, "kind": "action", "text": "But, good heavens, one has to put up with so much injustice in this world.", "para": 30, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 91, "kind": "action", "text": "There are the boys, Thomas!", "para": 30, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 92, "kind": "action", "text": "Look at them!", "para": 30, "sent": 4, "present": []}, {"u": 93, "kind": "action", "text": "What is to become of them?", "para": 30, "sent": 5, "present": []}, {"u": 94, "kind": "action", "text": "Oh, no, no, you can never have the heart\u2014.", "para": 30, "sent": 6, "present": []}, {"u": 95, "kind": "action", "text": "(EJLIF and MORTEN have come in, while she was speaking, with their school books in their hands.)", "para": 30, "sent": 7, "present": []}, {"u": 96, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann.", "para": 31, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 97, "kind": "action", "text": "The boys\u2014 I (Recovers himself suddenly.)", "para": 31, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 98, "kind": "action", "text": "No, even if the whole world goes to pieces, I will never bow my neck to this yokel (Goes towards his room.)", "para": 31, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 99, "kind": "action", "text": "Mrs. Stockmann (following him).", "para": 32, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 100, "kind": "action", "text": "Thomas\u2014what are you going to do!", "para": 32, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 101, "kind": "action", "text": "Dr. Stockmann (at his door).", "para": 33, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 102, "kind": "action", "text": "I mean to have the right to look my sons in the face when they are grown men.", "para": 33, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 103, "kind": "action", "text": "(Goes into his room.)", "para": 33, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 104, "kind": "action", "text": "Mrs. Stockmann (bursting into tears).", "para": 34, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 105, "kind": "action", "text": "God help us all!", "para": 34, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 106, "kind": "action", "text": "Petra.", "para": 35, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 107, "kind": "action", "text": "Father is splendid!", "para": 35, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 108, "kind": "action", "text": "He will not give in.", "para": 35, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 109, "kind": "action", "text": "(The boys look on in amazement; PETRA signs to them not to speak.)", "para": 36, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 110, "kind": "action", "text": "(SCENE.\u2014The editorial office of the \"People's Messenger.\"", "para": 37, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 111, "kind": "action", "text": "The entrance door is on the left-hand side of the back wall; on the right-hand side is another door with glass panels through which the printing room can be seen.", "para": 37, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 112, "kind": "action", "text": "Another door in the right-hand wall.", "para": 37, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 113, "kind": "action", "text": "In the middle of the room is a large table covered with papers, newspapers and books.", "para": 37, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 114, "kind": "action", "text": "In the foreground on the left a window, before which stands a desk and a high stool.", "para": 37, "sent": 4, "present": []}, {"u": 115, "kind": "action", "text": "There are a couple of easy chairs by the table, and other chairs standing along the wall.", "para": 37, "sent": 5, "present": []}, {"u": 116, "kind": "action", "text": "The room is dingy and uncomfortable; the furniture is old, the chairs stained and torn.", "para": 37, "sent": 6, "present": []}, {"u": 117, "kind": "action", "text": "In the printing room the compositors are seen at work, and a printer is working a handpress.", "para": 37, "sent": 7, "present": []}, {"u": 118, "kind": "action", "text": "HOVSTAD is sitting at the desk, writing.", "para": 37, "sent": 8, "present": []}, {"u": 119, "kind": "action", "text": "BILLING comes in from the right with DR. STOCKMANN'S manuscript in his hand.)", "para": 37, "sent": 9, "present": []}, {"u": 120, "kind": "action", "text": "Billing.", "para": 38, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 121, "kind": "action", "text": "Well, I must say!", "para": 38, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 122, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad (still writing).", "para": 39, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 123, "kind": "action", "text": "Have you read it through?", "para": 39, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 124, "kind": "action", "text": "Billing (laying the MS. on the desk).", "para": 40, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 125, "kind": "action", "text": "Yes, indeed I have.", "para": 40, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 126, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 41, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 127, "kind": "action", "text": "Don't you think the Doctor hits them pretty hard?", "para": 41, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 128, "kind": "action", "text": "Billing.", "para": 42, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 129, "kind": "action", "text": "Hard?", "para": 42, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 130, "kind": "action", "text": "Bless my soul, he's crushing!", "para": 42, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 131, "kind": "action", "text": "Every word falls like\u2014how shall I put it?\u2014like the blow of a sledgehammer.", "para": 42, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 132, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 43, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 133, "kind": "action", "text": "Yes, but they are not the people to throw up the sponge at the first blow.", "para": 43, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 134, "kind": "action", "text": "Billing.", "para": 44, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 135, "kind": "action", "text": "That is true; and for that reason we must strike blow upon blow until the whole of this aristocracy tumbles to pieces.", "para": 44, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 136, "kind": "action", "text": "As I sat in there reading this, I almost seemed to see a revolution in being.", "para": 44, "sent": 2, "present": []}]}